1
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,509
♪The world keeps changing♪

2
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:19,979
♪A thousand years pass
in the blink of an eye♪

3
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:22,159
♪Shoulder to shoulder♪

4
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:24,399
♪We stand above the world♪

5
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,590
♪Our identities switch♪

6
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:29,320
♪The world turns upside down♪

7
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,729
♪Watch me♪

8
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:35,319
♪Stir up a storm♪

9
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,609
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

10
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:40,059
♪Our blood is boiling♪

11
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:45,289
♪The genius emperor plots
with brilliant strategy♪

12
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:49,709
♪The slacker general
is unmatched in battle♪

13
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:52,199
♪The business world is in turmoil♪

14
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,749
♪The court is rife with intrigue♪

15
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:59,169
♪We will conquer the world♪

16
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:03,510
♪There's no escape for the traitors♪

17
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:07,999
=No Way! My Bro Is the Emperor=

18
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,160
=Episode 23=

19
00:01:12,130 --> 00:01:12,930
Official Li,

20
00:01:13,100 --> 00:01:15,019
the Western Yi
have surrounded the capital.

21
00:01:15,020 --> 00:01:15,739
What...

22
00:01:15,740 --> 00:01:17,220
What do we do now?

23
00:01:18,970 --> 00:01:20,170
What else can we do?

24
00:01:20,210 --> 00:01:21,860
Leave it to fate.

25
00:01:22,050 --> 00:01:22,739
Could it be

26
00:01:22,740 --> 00:01:24,090
His Majesty has fled?

27
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:27,700
His Majesty arrives!

28
00:01:28,310 --> 00:01:30,409
If you're all so scared,

29
00:01:30,410 --> 00:01:31,810
you should run.

30
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:34,290
Your Majesty,

31
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:36,049
the Western Yi army is at our gates.

32
00:01:36,050 --> 00:01:37,459
The whole capital

33
00:01:37,460 --> 00:01:38,980
is in a panic.

34
00:01:39,460 --> 00:01:40,399
Does anyone

35
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:41,620
have a plan?

36
00:01:43,660 --> 00:01:44,930
I have a suggestion.

37
00:01:45,210 --> 00:01:46,539
Every minister here

38
00:01:46,540 --> 00:01:48,409
has household guards.

39
00:01:48,410 --> 00:01:50,370
Why not send them

40
00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:52,019
to fight?

41
00:01:52,020 --> 00:01:52,750
Uh...

42
00:01:53,130 --> 00:01:54,049
They're only servants

43
00:01:54,050 --> 00:01:55,939
who guard our homes.

44
00:01:55,940 --> 00:01:57,459
What are we supposed to do
if they leave?

45
00:01:57,460 --> 00:01:58,019
Exactly.

46
00:01:58,020 --> 00:01:59,780
And if the city falls, what then?

47
00:02:00,050 --> 00:02:01,010
Are you going to serve

48
00:02:01,210 --> 00:02:02,209
the next emperor?

49
00:02:02,210 --> 00:02:02,969
Official Gu!

50
00:02:02,970 --> 00:02:04,450
How dare you!

51
00:02:04,540 --> 00:02:05,810
Outrageous!

52
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:07,700
Your Majesty,

53
00:02:07,740 --> 00:02:08,489
the Princess Royal

54
00:02:08,490 --> 00:02:10,019
is still of royal blood.

55
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:11,019
We propose

56
00:02:11,020 --> 00:02:12,489
making peace with her.

57
00:02:12,490 --> 00:02:14,730
- We agree.
- We agree.

58
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:16,650
Your Majesty!

59
00:02:17,810 --> 00:02:18,580
Your Majesty!

60
00:02:20,260 --> 00:02:21,220
Your Majesty,

61
00:02:21,230 --> 00:02:21,739
someone

62
00:02:21,740 --> 00:02:23,180
requests an audience.

63
00:02:23,210 --> 00:02:23,839
Who?

64
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:25,780
My dear nephew.

65
00:02:27,810 --> 00:02:29,809
- The Princess Royal?
- What is she doing here?

66
00:02:29,810 --> 00:02:30,899
She's back.

67
00:02:30,900 --> 00:02:31,930
Great!

68
00:02:32,140 --> 00:02:33,060
There won't be a war.

69
00:02:33,210 --> 00:02:33,929
She's here

70
00:02:33,930 --> 00:02:34,650
to negotiate peace.

71
00:02:39,530 --> 00:02:41,130
You're still alive?

72
00:02:41,860 --> 00:02:43,290
If you're alive,

73
00:02:43,370 --> 00:02:44,790
why wouldn't I be?

74
00:02:44,810 --> 00:02:45,810
Guards.

75
00:02:46,020 --> 00:02:47,180
Seize her.

76
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:48,810
Wait.

77
00:02:50,060 --> 00:02:51,990
You came here alone,

78
00:02:52,550 --> 00:02:54,810
so you must have a backup plan.

79
00:02:55,860 --> 00:02:57,580
Smart as always.

80
00:02:58,060 --> 00:02:59,980
If I'm not allowed to leave the city

81
00:03:00,050 --> 00:03:01,780
within the hour,

82
00:03:02,300 --> 00:03:05,019
my army will attack at once.

83
00:03:05,020 --> 00:03:07,049
They're still fighting?

84
00:03:07,050 --> 00:03:08,460
We're doomed.

85
00:03:08,530 --> 00:03:09,339
Your Majesty.

86
00:03:09,340 --> 00:03:10,489
Your Highness.

87
00:03:10,490 --> 00:03:11,769
You're family.

88
00:03:11,770 --> 00:03:13,139
You can talk it out.

89
00:03:13,140 --> 00:03:15,099
That's right. You're a family.

90
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:16,299
- That's right.
- That's right.

91
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:17,349
Everything's negotiable.

92
00:03:17,350 --> 00:03:18,560
Xiao Ce,

93
00:03:18,980 --> 00:03:20,810
I'll give you three days.

94
00:03:21,180 --> 00:03:22,519
If you still refuse

95
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:24,849
to surrender,

96
00:03:24,850 --> 00:03:26,479
when the city falls,

97
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:27,620
no one in the capital

98
00:03:27,860 --> 00:03:29,560
will be spared.

99
00:03:29,650 --> 00:03:31,130
Are we all going to die?

100
00:03:31,460 --> 00:03:33,259
We'd better pack everything and run.

101
00:03:33,260 --> 00:03:34,930
You only want the throne.

102
00:03:35,650 --> 00:03:37,139
If I give it to you,

103
00:03:37,140 --> 00:03:38,970
will you spare the people?

104
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,230
The throne?

105
00:03:43,050 --> 00:03:44,180
That's not enough.

106
00:03:45,140 --> 00:03:46,570
Xiao Ce,

107
00:03:46,860 --> 00:03:49,530
to pull weeds,
you have to pull out the roots.

108
00:04:10,780 --> 00:04:12,520
This is travel money for you.

109
00:04:12,540 --> 00:04:14,040
There's a secret passage in the palace.

110
00:04:14,210 --> 00:04:15,259
Leave through it.

111
00:04:15,260 --> 00:04:16,429
You're sending us away now?

112
00:04:16,430 --> 00:04:18,749
Everyone else transmigrates
with an overpowered cheat

113
00:04:18,750 --> 00:04:20,259
and conquers the world alone.

114
00:04:20,260 --> 00:04:21,200
But us?

115
00:04:21,310 --> 00:04:22,540
The two of us

116
00:04:23,140 --> 00:04:24,900
can't even outsmart these ancient people.

117
00:04:31,260 --> 00:04:32,259
Your Majesty,

118
00:04:32,260 --> 00:04:33,380
why did you summon us?

119
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:34,529
You all know

120
00:04:34,530 --> 00:04:35,530
the situation.

121
00:04:35,820 --> 00:04:37,620
The Western Yi army
threatens from without,

122
00:04:37,710 --> 00:04:39,459
while the Princess Royal
has staged a coup.

123
00:04:39,460 --> 00:04:40,420
You are to

124
00:04:40,460 --> 00:04:41,780
leave the city with Gu Bei.

125
00:04:42,090 --> 00:04:43,379
Xiao Ling, Hulv,

126
00:04:43,380 --> 00:04:44,139
and Eunuch Xu

127
00:04:44,140 --> 00:04:45,640
will meet you outside the city

128
00:04:45,780 --> 00:04:46,929
and escort you to the plains.

129
00:04:46,930 --> 00:04:48,139
I'm not leaving.

130
00:04:48,140 --> 00:04:50,059
The palace is my home.

131
00:04:50,060 --> 00:04:51,089
I'm staying.

132
00:04:51,090 --> 00:04:51,939
Neither am I.

133
00:04:51,940 --> 00:04:53,459
I can help too.

134
00:04:53,460 --> 00:04:54,970
Your Majesty taught me

135
00:04:55,170 --> 00:04:56,289
that women are meant for more

136
00:04:56,290 --> 00:04:57,940
than competing for favor.

137
00:04:57,970 --> 00:04:59,050
I'm staying too.

138
00:04:59,970 --> 00:05:01,710
Though you are my consorts,

139
00:05:02,300 --> 00:05:03,259
we've never

140
00:05:03,260 --> 00:05:05,020
lived as husband and wife.

141
00:05:05,060 --> 00:05:06,860
At a time like this,

142
00:05:07,110 --> 00:05:08,780
I won't let you die in vain.

143
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,059
His Majesty is right.

144
00:05:11,060 --> 00:05:12,490
Why throw our lives away?

145
00:05:12,700 --> 00:05:13,669
Ladies,

146
00:05:13,670 --> 00:05:14,649
please go

147
00:05:14,650 --> 00:05:15,800
with my brother.

148
00:05:21,060 --> 00:05:22,260
I'll stay with His Majesty.

149
00:05:27,730 --> 00:05:28,460
Gu Bei,

150
00:05:28,650 --> 00:05:29,769
on graduation day,

151
00:05:29,770 --> 00:05:31,289
you said I died because of you

152
00:05:31,290 --> 00:05:32,590
and owed me your life.

153
00:05:32,940 --> 00:05:33,980
Now

154
00:05:36,650 --> 00:05:38,000
it's your turn to help me.

155
00:05:39,850 --> 00:05:40,810
Nan,

156
00:05:41,380 --> 00:05:42,340
be good.

157
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,560
If you don't leave now, none of us will.

158
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,229
Bei,

159
00:05:45,230 --> 00:05:46,650
you know me better than anyone.

160
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:48,510
I can't leave His Majesty.

161
00:05:48,650 --> 00:05:49,769
If you stay,

162
00:05:49,770 --> 00:05:51,020
you'll only distract Xiao.

163
00:05:51,460 --> 00:05:52,499
Have you considered

164
00:05:52,500 --> 00:05:53,739
what he'll do

165
00:05:53,740 --> 00:05:57,390
if you're captured and the Princess Royal
uses you against him?

166
00:06:06,290 --> 00:06:07,090
Go.

167
00:06:07,900 --> 00:06:08,940
I have a plan.

168
00:08:09,790 --> 00:08:11,459
Long live the Princess Royal!

169
00:08:11,460 --> 00:08:13,890
Long live!

170
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:18,040
(Taiji Hall)

171
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:40,160
(Taiji Hall)

172
00:08:44,570 --> 00:08:46,950
I thought you'd fled.

173
00:08:46,980 --> 00:08:48,350
Never expected

174
00:08:48,750 --> 00:08:50,499
you to have such backbone.

175
00:08:50,500 --> 00:08:51,580
I stayed

176
00:08:52,500 --> 00:08:54,190
to ask you one thing, Aunt.

177
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:55,970
Are the throne

178
00:08:56,380 --> 00:08:57,770
and power

179
00:08:58,450 --> 00:09:00,340
truly worth

180
00:09:01,260 --> 00:09:03,279
selling Fushou Cream,

181
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:04,570
ruining the people,

182
00:09:05,380 --> 00:09:07,580
allying with the Western Yi,

183
00:09:08,170 --> 00:09:09,929
condemning countless people of Jing

184
00:09:09,930 --> 00:09:11,179
to misery?

185
00:09:11,180 --> 00:09:12,580
In strategy

186
00:09:12,620 --> 00:09:13,929
or learning,

187
00:09:13,930 --> 00:09:16,250
I've never been second to anyone.

188
00:09:16,340 --> 00:09:17,770
Not you.

189
00:09:17,900 --> 00:09:20,529
Even your father couldn't compare to me.

190
00:09:20,530 --> 00:09:21,980
So why should you

191
00:09:22,100 --> 00:09:23,859
be born to the throne,

192
00:09:23,860 --> 00:09:25,770
while I live beneath another?

193
00:09:26,020 --> 00:09:27,060
If you can sit

194
00:09:27,260 --> 00:09:28,370
on that throne,

195
00:09:28,570 --> 00:09:30,820
then so can I.

196
00:09:31,890 --> 00:09:32,869
Since ancient times,

197
00:09:32,870 --> 00:09:34,570
to rule the realm

198
00:09:35,340 --> 00:09:36,770
is to bear the lives of its people.

199
00:09:37,380 --> 00:09:40,460
A ruler's heart must be with the people,

200
00:09:41,530 --> 00:09:42,219
not driven

201
00:09:42,220 --> 00:09:43,770
by selfish ambition.

202
00:09:44,740 --> 00:09:46,180
You're cold-hearted,

203
00:09:46,500 --> 00:09:47,610
merciless,

204
00:09:47,650 --> 00:09:49,370
and treat human lives as worthless.

205
00:09:49,450 --> 00:09:50,610
Someone like you

206
00:09:50,930 --> 00:09:52,700
has no right to the throne.

207
00:09:54,930 --> 00:09:57,169
You're all alone now,

208
00:09:57,170 --> 00:09:58,490
with nowhere left to turn,

209
00:09:58,530 --> 00:10:00,890
yet you still refuse to give up.

210
00:10:01,140 --> 00:10:03,569
Just three thousand Imperial Guards?

211
00:10:03,570 --> 00:10:04,859
How can they stand against

212
00:10:04,860 --> 00:10:06,540
my fifty thousand Western Yi cavalry?

213
00:10:11,850 --> 00:10:13,689
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

214
00:10:13,690 --> 00:10:16,089
♪Our spirit soars to the skies♪

215
00:10:16,090 --> 00:10:21,529
♪The brainy emperor plots the strategy♪

216
00:10:21,530 --> 00:10:25,889
♪The slacker general leads the charge♪

217
00:10:25,890 --> 00:10:28,289
♪Swords clash and warhorses thunder♪

218
00:10:28,290 --> 00:10:30,849
♪Let the history judge our deeds♪

219
00:10:30,850 --> 00:10:36,529
♪Our brotherhood is priceless♪

220
00:10:36,530 --> 00:10:42,090
♪Peace across the land, carefree at last♪

221
00:10:46,370 --> 00:10:48,410
♪Funny moments never stop♪

222
00:10:49,050 --> 00:10:51,250
♪Silly blunders never cease♪

223
00:10:51,450 --> 00:10:55,609
♪Yet through every up and down♪

224
00:10:55,610 --> 00:10:57,570
♪We create miracles♪

225
00:10:57,890 --> 00:11:00,330
♪From naive youths♪

226
00:11:00,610 --> 00:11:03,089
♪To legendary heroes♪

227
00:11:03,090 --> 00:11:05,009
♪This journey♪

228
00:11:05,010 --> 00:11:09,049
♪Is one we'll be proud of♪

229
00:11:09,050 --> 00:11:11,570
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

230
00:11:14,050 --> 00:11:16,930
♪Let's create♪

231
00:11:18,970 --> 00:11:26,890
♪A legend of our own♪
